    "preamble": "Obulasetty Hari Babu Al vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh., on 1 September, 2020 Author: D.Ramesh Bench: D.Ramesh The Hon'Ble Sri Justice D.Ramesh Criminal Petition No.3533 of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "This petition is filed under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 by the petitioners, who is accused Nos.1 and 2 in Crime No.405 of 2020 on the file of Lalapet Police Station, Guntur District. The offences alleged are under sections 188, 269, 272 and 420 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860, and Sections 58, 59 and 63 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, and consequently release TVS XL Moped No.AP 07 DP 4018. 2.",
